[[File:So Sorry 4.6.png|thumb|238x238px|Post Beta 4.6]]

When it was first released, So Sorry costed 7G for a 4/5 monster that would add 2 Doodlebogs (originally a 2G 3/3 vanilla monster) to your hand. '''Beta 4.6''' lowered its cost to 6G, making it more reliable and able to be placed alongside one or two Doodlebogs as soon as Turn 4.
[[File:So Sorry-0.png|thumb|242x242px|Beta 6.2]]'''Beta 6.2 '''nerfed it with -1 HP, '''Beta 10.2''' buffed it with another cost drop to 5G, and '''Beta 48.0''' buffed it again with +1 HP, reverting the previous nerf.

